### 1. Uji Method GET (Mengambil jadwal & Status 200 OK)
GET http://localhost/pemweb-obe/api/jadwal.php

### 2. Uji Method POST (Simulasi tambah jadwal sukses & Status 201 Created)
POST http://localhost/pemweb-obe/api/jadwal.php
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nama": "SB. HARAPAN BARU",
  "tujuan": "Tarakan",
  "harga": 150000,
  "berangkat": "08:00",
  "tiba": "10:00",
  "lokasi": "Dermaga 3"
}

### 3. Uji Method POST - JSON Tidak Valid (Status 400 Bad Request)
# Sengaja menghilangkan kutip ganda penutup pada properti "nama"
POST http://localhost/pemweb-obe/api/jadwal.php
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nama": "SB. HARAPAN BARU,
  "tujuan": "Tarakan",
  "harga": 150000
}

### 4. Uji Method POST - Gagal Validasi Aturan Bisnis (Status 422 Unprocessable Entity)
# Nama kapal melebihi batas 100 karakter
POST http://localhost/pemweb-obe/api/jadwal.php
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nama": "SB. KAPAL CEPAT SUPER KILAT EXPRESS TANPA HAMBATAN MELINTASI SAMUDRA HINDIA MENUJU TAK TERBATAS DAN MELAMPAUINYA",
  "tujuan": "Pulau Bunyu"
}

### 5. Uji Method DELETE - Metode Tidak Diizinkan (Status 405 Method Not Allowed)
DELETE http://localhost/pemweb-obe/api/jadwal.php